                {
                  "moduleId": "module_147",
                  "moduleType": "custom_html",
                  "title": "How to Replace",
                  "options": {
                    "html_content": {
                      "name": "Custom HTML Content",
                      "type": "html_content",
                      "default_value": "",
                      "value": "<section class=\"step-guide-section\">\n  <div class=\"step-guide-layout\">\n    <div class=\"step-guide-media\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.revolutionparts.io/00d43a1703c9241dcca9da0d452449dc/design/guides/cabin_filter_install.webp\" alt=\"Replacing cabin air filter\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"step-list\">\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n        <h3>Park your vehicle safely</h3>\n        <p>Park on a level surface, turn off the ignition, and engage the parking brake before beginning the replacement process.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n        <h3>Locate the cabin air filter housing</h3>\n        <p>Most cabin air filters are located behind the glove box, under the dashboard, or beneath the hood. Consult your owner’s manual for the exact location.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n        <h3>Access the filter compartment</h3>\n        <p>Remove any retaining clips, covers, or panels necessary to reach the cabin air filter housing.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">4</div>\n        <h3>Remove the old cabin air filter</h3>\n        <p>Carefully slide the old filter out of the housing, noting the airflow direction indicated on the filter.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">5</div>\n        <h3>Clean the filter housing</h3>\n        <p>Remove any dust, leaves, or debris from the housing using a clean cloth or vacuum.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">6</div>\n        <h3>Install the new cabin air filter</h3>\n        <p>Insert the new Mopar<sub>®</sub> cabin air filter, ensuring the airflow arrow is oriented correctly according to the housing markings.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">7</div>\n        <h3>Reinstall the cover and components</h3>\n        <p>Secure the filter housing cover and reinstall any panels, clips, or glove box components that were removed.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step-row\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">8</div>\n        <h3>Test the HVAC system</h3>\n        <p>Start the vehicle and run the heating and air conditioning system to verify proper airflow and operation.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
                    },
